  "decision": "FAIL / NO_CANDIDATE_ADMITTED / NO_ROBUST_FACTOR_PASS. F-VRP-PROXY increased full-history CAGR to 14.768240% but failed the preregistered +0.50 percentage-point CAGR gate, reduced Sharpe to 1.411748 versus V11 1.522263, raised MDD to 13.380275%, beat its availability-matched control in only 3/7 fixed folds, and had lower full Sharpe than C-VRP-ALWAYS 1.413664. The matched control itself reached 15.845239% CAGR, showing that the proxy did not add timing value beyond mechanically using more of V11's unused risk budget. Paired 63-session moving-block bootstrap over 20,000 replicates gave P(CAGR candidate > V11)=80.485% and P(Sharpe candidate > matched)=46.590%; bootstrap MDD P97.5 was 19.308%, and cumulative 25-trial DSR probability was 83.367%. Per the frozen stop rule, no realized-volatility-window, threshold, VIX-series, fill-fraction, event-definition or replacement rescue search is permitted. This daily-data proxy must not be represented as the canonical model-free variance risk premium.",
